OL,3,GNEWSADeadly horse disease outbreak
OL,4,Aconfirmed in Galloway
OL,5,
OL,6,FCases in south-west Scotland are
OL,7,Fgenerally rare but, although the
OL,8,Fdisease is not contagious, it is not
OL,9,Funcommon to see an outbreak in one
OL,10,Fparticular area.
